{"2529750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Raining City: Millions Recollections", "steam_appid": 2529750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4059800], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529750/extras/0f4aeac2eb3e66e6233f79a18896f9c1.avif?t=1770626786\" width=780 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young woman called Lyu Xuan wakes up one night with her chest covered in blood and a mysterious black hole in the palm of her hand. She’s got absolutely no clue as to what’s going on – and to make things even more strange, riches start pouring from her hand. From then on, many monsters will come to her, hoping to control that source of wealth…  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529750/extras/376faa9cb67efe4d2295f59492001120.avif?t=1770626786\" width=780 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a strange world that breaks all conventions; meet with humans and non-humans, and try to befriend them and help them with their plights so they can in turn help you out and uncover the truth of your new powers.  The island city of Stage is modern and prosperous, but gloomy and rainy – and it hides countless secrets under its gray mantle. You’ll have to explore Stage, including those supernatural areas hidden behind the veil of reason, to find the truth to what’s going on with you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit strange stores and use the riches that poured from your hand to buy bizarre items, trading back all the strange objects what you find during your journey. But keep track of how much you spend – the final destiny of your adventure will depend of it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529750/extras/cb8ebf11053ce641dfef57a967ea2bd2.avif?t=1770626786\" width=780 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your adventure, you will find many creatures interested in your wealth. Some will try to talk to you, others will be openly hostile. One of them will follow you like a loyal dog – dressed in white, with long black hair and a delicate shape, but with a huge mouth on the top of its head. Behind its meek behavior, there seems to be a fountain of rage capable of tearing apart anything that threatens you. Who’s this creature that seems to be so attached to you?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529750/extras/9e0afbed54fa7897af820402f217f637.avif?t=1770626786\" width=780 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth and advance in the story by exploring the city. You decide where to go next </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of your objective using Lyu Xuan’s smartphone and check information about the mysterious characters and monsters of Stage </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your level of wealth will affect the outcome of the game, so keep an eye on your finances</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529750/extras/cffbc17cfc2ee93cf89d0a4e9bda3b0e.avif?t=1770626786\" width=780 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529750/extras/ef9ced0452fa45aa3cf31f42446ae6f4.avif?t=1770626786\" width=1560 height=588 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The protagonist.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She works in a highly confidential field, gifted with extraordinary physical abilities, unshakable mental resilience, and striking beauty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529750/extras/06c2eb28b2642b8988a20f39455fabdb.avif?t=1770626786\" width=1560 height=588 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small, delicate creature with an enormous maw atop its head, this strange little monster trails after Lyu Xuan with the devotion of a loyal hound. Behind its moments of gentle charm lurks a ferocity that can shred any threat to pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529750/extras/3222d8a112f30492dc9d2ef5be85ec92.avif?t=1770626786\" width=1560 height=588 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>※Pursuable Heroine</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The daughter of the man who owns the Golden Tower in Egret City. A young &quot;princess&quot; who should have grown up pampered, yet fled her family under tragic circumstances—only to crash into Lyu Xuan’s life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529750/extras/002b8bac75117b15a7babb3ad7863faf.avif?t=1770626786\" width=1560 height=588 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>※Pursuable Heroine</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gentle voice like melody to the ears, and dim, soulful eyes brimming with emotion. She first met Lyu Xuan at a small temple, and from there, began to unravel a terrifying truth buried for millennia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529750/extras/6f2428bdb18eaede9465febb9b4a8796.avif?t=1770626786\" width=1560 height=588 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twin siblings raised by a mysterious traveling merchant beast. The sister, Jasper, is outgoing and lively; the brother, Cinnabar, is tender-hearted and reflective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529750/extras/6bc10c6dd9afc0fcb0468c20f55dd8e4.avif?t=1770626786\" width=1560 height=588 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cytology PhD specializing in the study of time and space, carrying with her a dangerous secret tied to the enigmatic &quot;Door.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529750/extras/2de0ec28f668b47558b6e9729607a671.avif?t=1770626786\" width=1560 height=588 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thousand-faced shapeshifter who roams the human world at will. It arrives in Egret City with one goal—to find the &quot;Door.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529750/extras/910947c02bb2fa81800441356a1f8a11.avif?t=1770626786\" width=1560 height=588 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Jasper&quot; of a previous era—an incarnation of danger itself—returning to Egret City to settle an old score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><spa